          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Forbidden Secret Program stands out because it is designed to fit into real life without demanding extreme time or effort. Many traditional manifestation or mindset methods rely on long meditation sessions, rigid routines, or complex practices that are difficult to maintain. This program takes a simpler approach, helping users move into a focused and receptive mental state quickly, without exhausting daily commitments. It is built for people who want meaningful change without overwhelming routines.<div><br></div><div>What makes the program effective is how each component works together as a complete system. The guided audio sessions help prepare the mind for focus and awareness. The Reality Codes support intentional thinking and help reshape unhelpful mental patterns. The digital guide provides structure and clarity, explaining each step so users always know what they are doing and why. Nothing is random or disconnected — every element is designed to support the others and create a consistent, easy-to-follow process.</div><div><br></div><div>For those who feel frustrated with slow, complicated methods, The Forbidden Secret offers a more approachable alternative. With regular use, many users report improved clarity, stronger confidence, and a greater sense of direction. Decisions often feel easier, mental confusion decreases, and opportunities may become easier to recognize. The program focuses on working with natural mental processes rather than forcing change through pressure or unrealistic expectations.</div><div><br></div><div>Another key advantage is flexibility. The entire program is delivered digitally and can be accessed anytime, anywhere. You can listen to the audio sessions when it suits you, use the Reality Codes at your own pace, and read the guide whenever you choose. There are no schedules, classes, or rigid requirements to follow. This flexibility makes it easier to stay consistent, which is essential for lasting personal growth. With steady use, the process supports meaningful internal shifts that can positively influence everyday life.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
